<http://data.silknow.org/object/c8048314-3af5-328e-8beb-21f32e40621b>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "J.F. Hayward., <u>European Armour</u>, HMSO, London, 1965, cat. 37\nPatterson, Angus, <u>Fashion and Armour in Renaissance Europe: Proud Lookes and Brave Attire</u>, V&A Publishing, London, 2009, ISBN  9781851775811, p. 52, ill.\nPatterson, Angus, \"Power and Glory\", chapter, in Medlam, Sarah and Miller, Lesley Ellis, <u>Princely Treasures: European Masterpieces 1600-1800</u>, exhibition catalogue, V&A Publishing, 2011, ISBN9781851776337, p. 46-7, ill."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/f91488f5-f34c-3340-9317-473460c772b3> ;
