        ecrm:P3_has_note    "J.F. Hayward., <u>European Armour</u>, HMSO, London, 1965, cat. 37\nPatterson, Angus, <u>Fashion and Armour in Renaissance Europe: Proud Lookes and Brave Attire</u>, V&A Publishing, London, 2009, ISBN  9781851775811, p. 52, ill.\nPatterson, Angus, \"Power and Glory\", chapter, in Medlam, Sarah and Miller, Lesley Ellis, <u>Princely Treasures: European Masterpieces 1600-1800</u>, exhibition catalogue, V&A Publishing, 2011, ISBN9781851776337, p. 46-7, ill."@en .

<http://data.silknow.org/image/3e441a9a-dcab-362b-b107-ec9d4da2dba9>
        a                  ecrm:E38_Image ;
        dc:identifier      "2012FU4762" ;
